                    options: ["Heterozygous dominant individual", "Homozygous recessive individual", "Homozygous dominant individual", "Mutated individual"],
                    answer: 1
                    // To find out if a dominant-looking organism is purebred (AA) or a carrier (Aa), you cross it with a known homozygous recessive (aa). 
